{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"『由香里』の母親。 そのように育ってきたためか、とても厳格な性格の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々小金持ちの生まれだが、数年前に両親が亡くなってからは会社を売却し、株や土地でひっそりと暮らしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親の不仲、とりわけ父親の不倫騒動などを見て育ったため、もともと男性嫌いな所がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妊娠中の夫の裏切りを知ってしまい、すぐに夫と離縁、さらに男性嫌いに拍車がかかってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今は可愛い一人娘が道を誤らないようにと、やや厳しめの躾をしている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"147354"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"96 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22000","sourceWorkId":"8575","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"167 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22000","sourceWorkId":"8575","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"95 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22000","sourceWorkId":"8575","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"61 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22000","sourceWorkId":"8575","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"52 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22000","sourceWorkId":"8575","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1c/1c72d3905dc4b8f21fbe536f3d58ef283b165fe232832031a7033d9ab4eeb415.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/48/48b767b2b90f7d6074abcfc4b50881f695e0675600db39eec6c058d92dff3b3f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"MARIO","creatorId":"vndb:s632","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s632","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s632","name":"紫苑 みやび","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:300799:147354:4918:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c8052","characterName":"佐々木 舞","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"147353","m